        "local_guide": true,
        "reviews": 119,
        "photos": 287
      },
      "snippet": "Worst experience as a first time visitor. Will never be back. Coffee was great. Service was not. We were in line (3 people deep) - employee asked us to move the line to the left of the register. Only to help someone that just walked in over us - who were already waiting. I said something like hi uh we were also in line and was ignored. I got an egg, ham and cheese croissant and asked for no egg. All the food is pre made and heated up so you can’t modify anything. Okay, fine - I’ll take the egg off myself. I open it.. it’s FREEZING COLD. I have to ask the employee to reheat it again. the whole visit was such an inconvenience and I wish I went somewhere else. Spent $20 for not a good breakfast. Seemed like it would be a good vibes place so I was excited but was let down.",
      "extracted_snippet": {
        "original": "Worst experience as a first time visitor. Will never be back. Coffee was great. Service was not. We were in line (3 people deep) - employee asked us to move the line to the left of the register. Only to help someone that just walked in over us - who were already waiting. I said something like hi uh we were also in line and was ignored. I got an egg, ham and cheese croissant and asked for no egg. All the food is pre made and heated up so you can’t modify anything. Okay, fine - I’ll take the egg off myself. I open it.. it’s FREEZING COLD. I have to ask the employee to reheat it again. the whole visit was such an inconvenience and I wish I went somewhere else. Spent $20 for not a good breakfast. Seemed like it would be a good vibes place so I was excited but was let down."
      },
